Suzanne M. Jansze graduated in Molecular Life Sciences from Wageningen University, The Netherlands, in 2014. She is currently a PhD candidate in the Laboratory of Supramolecular Chemistry at the Ecole Polytechnique Fédérale de Lausanne (EPFL), Switzerland. Her work entails the synthesis of nanostructures and novel materials based on polyfunctional clathrochelates.
